From tliu at fhcrc.org  Fri Feb  3 18:56:27 2006
From: tliu at fhcrc.org (Ting-Yuan Liu)
Date: Fri, 3 Feb 2006 09:56:27 -0800 (PST)
Subject: [BioC] Annotation packages for E.Coli
In-Reply-To: <4084772.1138906545044.JavaMail.root@webmail01.auna.data>
References: <4084772.1138906545044.JavaMail.root@webmail01.auna.data>
Message-ID: <Pine.LNX.4.61.0602030946320.11406@jade.fhcrc.org>


Hi Alex,

I don't think we have the annotation package for this array so far.  The 
annotation packages we have built are mostly for Affymetrix arrays, and 
some for other companies' arrays (such as Clontech BD Atlas, 
Qiagen, Agilent, etc).  I don't remember we have any annotation packages 
for MWG company.  

You can use the package AnnBuilder to build your own annotation package 
for the array.  You can find the details in the vignette "Basic Functions 
of AnnBuilder" 
(http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/bioc/1.8/vignettes/AnnBuilder/inst/doc/AnnBuilder.pdf)

HTH,
Ting-Yuan
