CDF file.  In this file, I found that Affymetrix confused  
"AF027865_1_s_at" and "AF027865_s_at" in "Unit3403_Block1", and Affymetrix 
also confused "AF027865_2_s_at" and "af027865_s_at" in "Unit3404_Block1".  

